WEBVTT

00:00:27.273 --> 00:00:30.651
just a reminder that people choose.

00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:32.445
We are not algorithms.

00:00:32.445 --> 00:00:38.618
We are not bound by code
or commandments or laws or treaties.

00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:39.786
We have them.

00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:42.121
But we choose.

00:00:43.122 --> 00:00:47.710
So let us talk now
about the choices we make.

00:00:47.752 --> 00:00:51.005
About things in black and white.

00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:54.717
About Russia's war on Ukraine.

00:00:55.176 --> 00:00:57.011
And about good and evil.

00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:04.519
My life experience prepared me
to identify evil at an early age.